OL,3,GNEWSAHospital partners with police to
OL,4,Atackle abuse of staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has introduced a national
OL,7,Fcampaign to tackle violence and abuse
OL,8,Fagainst its staff.
OL,10,FOxford University Hospitals NHS
OL,11,FFoundation Trust (OUH) has partnered
OL,12,Fwith Thames Valley Police to bring a
OL,13,Fscheme known as Operation Cavell to the
OL,14,FJohn Radcliffe Hospital.
OL,16,FThe campaign will see the local NHS
OL,17,FTrust, police force and the Crown
OL,18,FProsecution Service come together to
OL,19,F"strengthen protections for NHS staff,
OL,20,Fimprove conviction rates and support
OL,21,Fvictims".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
