OL,3,GNEWSAHospital partners with police to
OL,4,Atackle abuse of staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said the co-ordinated
OL,7,Fapproach was designed to send a clear
OL,8,Fmessage that violence and abuse against
OL,9,FOUH staff was taken seriously, and
OL,10,Fshould not be tolerated as "part of the
OL,11,Fjob".
